From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:18:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD reviewed patch-agent completion confirmation so
 finished chats can close and reopen

Review results prompt the patch-agent chat for an explicit yes/no completion decision. Yes closes and hides the finished feature chat, no records an open state without contacting the backend, and follow-up text reopens the chat before sending it as the next agent prompt.
